Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Uche Nsonwu-Amadi represent or represent?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "**Breaking News: Nigerian Basketball Sensation Uche Nsonwu-Amadi Joins Wyoming Cowboys Basketball**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 101, "end": 331, "text": "Laramie, WY - In a move that is set to shake up the college basketball landscape, Nigerian basketball player Uche Nsonwu-Amadi has officially joined the Wyoming Cowboys basketball team, sources close to the program have confirmed."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 332, "end": 499, "text": "The 6'10\" forward, known for his dominant rebounding and shot-blocking abilities, is expected to bring a new level of athleticism and intensity to the Cowboys' lineup."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 500, "end": 634, "text": "Nsonwu-Amadi's decision to join Wyoming is a significant coup for the program, which has been looking to bolster its frontcourt depth."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 635, "end": 727, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Uche to the Cowboy family,\" said Wyoming head coach Jeff Linder."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 728, "end": 801, "text": "\"He brings a unique set of skills and a high level of energy to our team."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 802, "end": 931, "text": "We believe he has the potential to make an immediate impact and help us compete at a high level in the Mountain West Conference.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 1097, "text": "Nsonwu-Amadi, who hails from Lagos, Nigeria, has a storied basketball background, having played for the Nigerian national team in several international competitions."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1098, "end": 1208, "text": "His impressive resume includes a stint with the Nigerian U-18 team that won the 2018 FIBA Africa Championship."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1209, "end": 1313, "text": "\"Uche is an exceptional talent with a strong work ethic,\" said Nigerian national team coach, Alex Nwora."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1314, "end": 1439, "text": "\"He has a bright future ahead of him, and we're excited to see him take his game to the next level with the Wyoming Cowboys.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1440, "end": 1604, "text": "According to data from the NCAA, Nsonwu-Amadi's addition to the Cowboys' roster is expected to significantly improve the team's rebounding and defensive statistics."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1605, "end": 1724, "text": "Last season, Wyoming ranked 9th in the Mountain West Conference in rebounding margin, averaging 34.5 rebounds per game."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1725, "end": 1817, "text": "With Nsonwu-Amadi's presence in the paint, the Cowboys are expected to improve on that mark."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1818, "end": 1938, "text": "\"We're excited to see how Uche's skills will translate to the college game,\" said Wyoming athletic director, Tom Burman."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1939, "end": 2039, "text": "\"He's a game-changer, and we're confident that he'll help us compete for a conference championship.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2040, "end": 2168, "text": "Nsonwu-Amadi is set to join the Cowboys for the upcoming season, which tips off on November 5th against the Idaho State Bengals."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2169, "end": 2327, "text": "Fans can expect to see him in action at the Arena-Auditorium, where he'll look to make an immediate impact and help the Cowboys return to the NCAA Tournament."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 169, "text": "As the sun dipped into the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Gothenburg, Uche Nsonwu-Amadi made his way to the BK Häcken training grounds."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 170, "end": 422, "text": "The Nigerian basketball player, known for his lightning-quick reflexes and razor-sharp instincts on the court, had just arrived in Sweden a week ago, and was still getting accustomed to the chill in the air and the melodic lilt of the Swedish language."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 423, "end": 573, "text": "As he walked through the gates, he was greeted by the team's coach, a gruff but kind-hearted man named Lars, who was busy setting up the day's drills."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 574, "end": 585, "text": "\"Hej, Uche!"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 586, "end": 681, "text": "Welcome to Häcken,\" Lars boomed, his eyes crinkling at the corners as he extended a meaty hand."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 682, "end": 747, "text": "Uche smiled, his bright white teeth flashing in the fading light."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 748, "end": 849, "text": "\"Tack, coach,\" he replied, his Swedish still a work in progress, but improving with each passing day."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 850, "end": 940, "text": "As he began to warm up, Uche couldn't help but feel a sense of excitement and trepidation."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 941, "end": 1124, "text": "He had never played football before, but Lars had seen something in him during a chance encounter at a charity basketball tournament in Lagos, and had convinced him to give it a shot."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1125, "end": 1258, "text": "Uche had always been a natural athlete, and Lars was convinced that his quickness and agility would translate perfectly to the pitch."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1259, "end": 1349, "text": "As the training session got underway, Uche struggled to keep up with the pace of the game."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1350, "end": 1422, "text": "His footwork was clumsy, and his passes often sailed wide of their mark."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1423, "end": 1536, "text": "But Lars was patient, offering words of encouragement and gentle corrections as Uche stumbled through the drills."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1537, "end": 1714, "text": "Just as Uche was starting to feel like he was getting the hang of things, a tall, lanky player with a mop of curly hair sauntered onto the pitch, a mischievous glint in his eye."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1715, "end": 1745, "text": "\"Hey, Uche, what's the hurry?\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1746, "end": 1799, "text": "he asked, his Swedish accent dripping with amusement."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1800, "end": 1867, "text": "Uche grinned, feeling a sense of camaraderie with his new teammate."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1868, "end": 2008, "text": "\"Just trying to keep up, Leo,\" he replied, using the nickname Lars had told him was reserved for the team's star midfielder, Leonardo Silva."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2009, "end": 2049, "text": "Leo chuckled, clapping Uche on the back."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2050, "end": 2069, "text": "\"Don't worry, mate."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2070, "end": 2107, "text": "We'll get you up to speed in no time."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2108, "end": 2210, "text": "And who knows, maybe you'll even teach us a thing or two about those fancy basketball moves of yours.\""}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "BK Häcken", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Uche Nsonwu-Amadi", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Uche Nsonwu-Amadi made his way to the BK Häcken training grounds and was welcomed by the team's coach as a new player.", "answer": "BK Häcken", "quote": "As the sun dipped into the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Gothenburg, Uche Nsonwu-Amadi made his way to the BK Häcken training grounds. The Nigerian basketball player, known for his lightning-quick reflexes and razor-sharp instincts on the court, had just arrived in Sweden a week ago, and was still getting accustomed to the chill in the air and the melodic lilt of the Swedish language. As he walked through the gates, he was greeted by the team's coach, a gruff but kind-hearted man named Lars, who was busy setting up the day's drills. \"Hej, Uche! Welcome to Häcken,\" Lars boomed, his eyes crinkling at the corners as he extended a meaty hand.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Wyoming Cowboys", "BK Häcken"]}

